    <image class="about-logo" src="/assets/icons/brand-avatar.svg" mode="aspectFit" />
    <view class="about-name">拼豆制作工具</view>
    <view class="about-version">Version 0.7.0</view>

    <view class="about-intro">
      <view class="about-intro__title"><text>i</text> 产品介绍</view>
      <view class="about-intro__body">
        <view>拼豆制作工具是一款专为拼豆爱好者打造的创作助手。</view>
        <view>支持上传图片，智能识别并生成拼豆图、施工图和材料清单，帮助你轻松完成每一件拼豆作品。</view>
      </view>
      <image src="/assets/icons/bead-stack.svg" mode="aspectFit" />
    </view>

    <view class="about-menu ui-card">
      <view class="about-menu__item" data-id="features" bindtap="openItem"><text class="about-menu__icon about-menu__icon--green">◆</text><view>功能特色</view><text>›</text></view>
